      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "'One Time Code\" is referring to the fact that its a code, and it works one time. \n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-time_password\n\nPersonally I use my meta or steam account to log in to VRChat. But I agree that the lifespan of VRChat session is too short.",
