  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Now in days, I hop on VRC less frequently and that means have to authenticate with the \"one-time code\" more frequently, which is a royal pain when you have a VR headset strapped to your face. I am on the same computer and with the same set up but get asked for this code more frequently then I would like. Can the time between authentications be extended longer? Or just get rid of the authentication all together? Or if it needs to stay, please rename it to something other then \"One-time code\" because its not one time at all.\n\nThank you for your consideration!",
